  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 131e1dca5f7f2ca42be00771cea61f30, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafeStreets.Conversation
  speakerName: Driver Dee
  lines:
  - Hi there! I drive the school bus. Name's Dee.
  - Stand two big steps back from the curb while you wait - I need room to pull in
    and see you.
  - Wait until I stop AND wave you forward before you walk to the door.
  - And if you drop something near my bus, tell me. Never crawl underneath for it.
    That is the one rule I never bend.
  closingTip: Rules from the K-12 Traffic Safety Education Resource Guide
